    LineComment "// The string introspection substrate: len, at, slice, chars, and bytes read an"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// immutable string's contents, and every one folds at compile time. Length,"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// indexing, and slicing count Unicode codepoints (runes), not bytes — \"héllo\""
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// is five runes though its UTF-8 form is six bytes — so the substrate the std"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// string module is built on is rune-correct from the start."
